{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111714","id":2920322068,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6uEJQU","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111714","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111714.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111714.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111714","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111714/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111714/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111714/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7b70bd5d58228a10b2b6e04298c3f1a04be125d3","number":111714,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add support for joypad touchpads","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14481\r\n\r\nI decided to split my big SDL3 joypad features PR ( https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107967 ) into several smaller PRs, this PR is one of them.\r\n\r\nThis PR adds the ability to use touchpads on supported controllers, such as DualShock 4, DualSense ~~and (most likely) Steam Deck built-in controls~~ (EDIT: apparently not, since \"thirdparty/sdl/joystick/hidapi/SDL_hidapi_steamdeck.c\" file doesn't have any references to touchpads).\r\n\r\nCurrently there's no InputEvent that gets fired when a finger appears/moves on a touchpad.\r\n\r\nTODO:\r\n- [x] Mark as experimental\r\n- [x] Add a note about Android automatically turning joypad touchpads into a mouse cursor\r\n- [x] Test on iOS later after https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114316 is merged\r\n- [x] Write a proposal\r\n- [x] Make `p_touchpad` have the default value of `0`\r\n- [x] Allow touchpad events to be ignored if joypad input is disabled on unfocused application\r\n- ~~Input events, including a motion event with movement vector~~ (Can be done in a separate PR if required)\r\n- [x] Method for getting the pressure value\r\n- [x] Default value for `get_joy_touchpad_fingers` method touchpad parameter\r\n\r\nTODO for a separate PR:\r\n- [x] Track presses/releases separately from pressure in `joy_touchpad()` method ( https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120578 )\r\n- [x] I think returning `Vector2(-1, -1)` for position and `-1` for pressure would make more sense here. ( https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120578 )\r\n- [x] `InputEventJoypadTouchpadPress` (press/release) ( https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120579 )\r\n- [x] `InputEventJoypadTouchpadMotion` (finger motion, with initial position and velocity to make things easier) ( https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120579 )\r\n- [ ] Tutorial","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archi